  "summary": "Malicious code in tyepescript-cli (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook (scripts/postinstall.js) fingerprints the host (platform, arch, node version, WSL detection via /proc/version) and POSTs the platform to C2 193[.]70[.]34[.]101:20099/vote. On Windows or WSL hosts it then downloads a second-stage binary main.exe from a GitHub release URL (hxxps://github[.]com/be[.][.][.]/releases/download/null/main[.]exe) and executes it detached with stdio ignored and windowsHide, or via an exec bridge on WSL. The package is a typosquat of typescript-cli.",
